%N A402136 Numbers k such that 11^k in contains in its decimal representation 11*k as a substring.
%C A402136 Special case in base 10 of numbers k such that (B+1)^k contains (B+1)*k when expressed in base B. For B>3, 1 and 3 are always members since 11 and 1331 contain 11 and 33 without carrying, which never happens for B>3.
%H A402136 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A402136/b402136.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..1000</a>
%e A402136 For n=1, 11^1=11 contains 11*1=11.
%e A402136 For n=3, 11^3=1_33_1 contains 11*3=33.
%e A402136 For n=8, 11^8=214358_88_1 contains 11*8=88.
%o A402136 (PARI) isok(m)=my(t=11*m, d=logint(t,10)+1, q=11^m); for(i=0, d-1, if(setsearch(Set(digits(q,10^d)), t), return(1)); q\=10); 0 \\ _Andrew Howroyd_, Nov 13 2026
%o A402136 (Python)
%o A402136 def ok(k): return str(11*k) in str(11**k)
%o A402136 print([k for k in range(1500) if ok(k)]) # _Michael S. Branicky_, Nov 13 2026
